                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It is very difficult to win a race, not due to anything you do but the fact that even if you are way ahead you will always get caught up by everyone. If you crash or get taken out by AI cars then you can never catch up the pack again. Seems a bit unfair which makes the game frustrating. If they could sort this problem out then it might be worth giving it a shot. As it is I spent 15 minutes on it and soon realised I wouldn't be getting anywhere. \nI can't recommend it in its current state.",
